It is getting late now.
I think that I will go home now.
I take my bag and get ready to leave.
I say to Priya, 'Priya, it was a lot of fun today.'
'The food was very nice, thank you very much.'
Priya smiles and says, 'I also felt very happy.'
'I really liked that you came.'
I tell her, 'Next time you must come to my flat.'
'I will make special Mexican food for you.'
'I think that you will definitely like it.'
Priya says with enthusiasm, 'Oh wow!'
'I will definitely come.'
'I like Mexican food a lot.'
'Let's decide on a day for this soon,' she adds.
I say, 'Yes, let's talk about this in the office next week.'
I go near the door.
'Good night, Priya, see you on Monday,' I say.
'Good night, Maya, go carefully,' she says.
I say goodbye to Priya and step outside.
I think that I have found a nice friend today.
